/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:94: [行の長さ 626 字。当たった 1 か所の前後 200 字] …One of the most common misconceptions among new traders is believing that a profitable backtest automatically validates a strategy. It does not. A backtest evaluates performance using historical data; it cannot determine whether the same strategy will remain effective when future market conditions differ. For exam…
