/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_how-to-vibe-trade.txt:456: Forward testing can expose problems that were difficult to see during development.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_how-to-vibe-trade.txt:465: Forward testing is not proof of future profitability. It is a way to observe a frozen strategy outside the historical development process.
