/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_how-to-vibe-trade.txt:524: If the strategy is still changing, the backtest is measuring a moving target.
