/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:208: Trading strategy validation is the process of determining whether a trading strategy is robust enough to perform beyond the historical data used during development. It combines multiple testing methods rather than relying on a single backtest.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:209: How do you validate a trading strategy?
