/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:213: What is the difference between backtesting and strategy validation?
