/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:216: A strategy is generally considered ready only after demonstrating consistent results across multiple validation stages, including acceptable risk metrics, successful forward testing, and robust performance under different market conditions.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:217: What is the difference between validation and optimization?
