/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:222: Yes. Many historically profitable strategies fail after deployment because of overfitting, market regime changes, execution costs, or insufficient validation.
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-037r18/pages_text/blog_trading-strategy-validation.txt:223: How long should a strategy be validated?
